    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"small steps\" thing just feels like a cope for people who already gave up. i didn't work this hard just to exist in the middle of the pack. there's no dignity in just being \"okay\" or \"consistent.\" if you aren't moving toward the top, you're just taking up space. it honestly feels like i've wasted my time just waiting for a greatness that was never actually coming.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
